│   │   └── Models/                 # Shared application models
│   │
│   ├── Domain/                     # Core business logic (zero external dependencies)
│   │   ├── Entity.cs               # Base entity (Id, CreatedAt, UpdatedAt, DeletedAt)
│   │   ├── Accounts/               # Account entity, errors, constants, AccountType enum
│   │   ├── AccountOperations/      # AccountOperation entity, errors, constants
│   │   ├── Tags/                   # Tag entity, errors, constants
