│   │
│   └── Infrastructure/             # External concerns implementation
│       ├── Authentication/         # PasswordHasher
│       └── Persistence/            # AppDbContext, migrations, initializer
│
├── tests/
│   ├── Api.Tests/                  # Integration tests (WebApplicationFactory + Testcontainers)
│   ├── Architecture.Tests/         # Architecture constraint tests (NetArchTest)
│   ├── Domain.Tests/               # Pure domain unit tests
